		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=14700#p14700"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour à tous,</p><p>Je travaille sur des bases en 8.4 et 9.0 sous CentOs 5.4</p><p>Dans la table PG_STAT_ACTIVITY j&#039;ai la ligne suivante :</p><p> datid | datname | procpid | usesysid |&#160; usename&#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; current_query&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | waiting |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; xact_start&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; query_start<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;backend_start&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; client_addr&#160; | client_port<br />-------+---------+---------+----------+------------+---------------------------------+---------+-------------------------------+-------------------------<br />------+-------------------------------+---------------+-------------<br /> 16384 | teo&#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; 7915 |&#160; &#160; 16417 | teoodi&#160; &#160; &#160;| &lt;IDLE&gt; in transaction&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;| f&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;| 2012-08-06 15:07:48.317148+03 | 2012-08-06 16:02:52.7584<br />85+03 | 2012-08-06 15:07:46.924044+03 | 11.11.4.34&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;27526</p><br /><p>Dans la table PG_LOCKS j&#039;ai des lignes du style :</p><p>&#160; &#160;locktype&#160; &#160; | database | relation | page | tuple | virtualxid | transactionid | classid | objid | objsubid | virtualtransaction |&#160; pid&#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;mode<br />&#160; &#160; &#160;| granted<br />---------------+----------+----------+------+-------+------------+---------------+---------+-------+----------+--------------------+-------+-------------<br />-----+---------<br /> relation&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; 16384 |&#160; &#160; &#160;2690 |&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | 5/192095&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; 7915 | AccessShareL<br />ock&#160; | t<br /> relation&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; 16384 |&#160; &#160; &#160;2663 |&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | 5/192095&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; 7915 | AccessShareL<br />ock&#160; | t<br /> relation&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; 16384 |&#160; &#160; &#160;1247 |&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | 5/192095&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; 7915 | AccessShareL<br />ock&#160; | t<br /> relation&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; 16384 |&#160; &#160; &#160;2675 |&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | 5/192095&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; 7915 | AccessShareL<br />ock&#160; | t<br /> relation&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; 16384 |&#160; &#160; &#160;1259 |&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | 5/192095&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; 7915 | AccessShareL<br />ock&#160; | t<br /> relation&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; 16384 |&#160; &#160; &#160;2658 |&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | 5/192095&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; 7915 | AccessShareL<br />ock&#160; | t<br /> relation&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; 16384 |&#160; &#160; 16742 |&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | 5/192095&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; 7915 | AccessShareL<br />ock&#160; | t</p><br /><p>Parfois il n&#039;y a rien dans la colonne XACT_START de pg_stat_activity;</p><p>Y-a-t&#039;il un problème de verrou ?</p><p>Merci pour votre aide.</p>]]></content>
